OL,3,GNEWSATraders call for action over
OL,4,Astreet drinking
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners in York have said
OL,7,Fstreet drinking and anti-social
OL,8,Fbehaviour are putting visitors off part
OL,9,Fof the city centre.
OL,11,FTraders in Colliergate and nearby St
OL,12,FSaviourgate said disorderly behaviour,
OL,13,Fincluding public drinking, shouting and
OL,14,Fintimidation, had become a regular
OL,15,Fproblem.
OL,17,FThey said groups often gathered near
OL,18,Fthe junction with Whip-Ma-Whop-Ma-Gate,
OL,19,Fwith some tourists choosing to avoid
OL,20,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
