OL,3,GNEWSATraders call for action over
OL,4,Astreet drinking
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Addy, manager of No 1-4 News,
OL,7,Fsaid: "They shout and bawl, drink, some
OL,8,Fof them pass out and are lying on the
OL,9,Ffloor."
